--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT THE WEB PAGE IS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ArchivedPage.tsx is the notifications inbox scoped to archived items. It calls
useVehicles() + useAlertRules(), renders a PageContainer (title, subtitle,
copyLink, "Back to inbox" action) and reuses <InboxBody archived={true}
vehicles rules /> so the bulk-action set swaps Archive -> Restore. The web
InboxBody owns the notification-log feeds (useNotificationLogs /
useNotificationGroups) + the inbox mutations and builds ruleMap (rule.id->rule)
and vehicleMap (vehicle.id->vehicle) from the two props to label rows and decide
drill-through (rule = ruleMap[log.alert_id]; vehicle = vehicleMap[rule.vehicle_id]).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NATIVE IMPLEMENTATION (no placeholders, ADR-011; no delegation)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The shared A3 InboxBody feature-view already exists
(io.teslasync.android.featureviews.inboxbody.InboxBody) and owns every inbox
data state (loading skeleton / hard-error+retry / archived empty / content /
stale-offline) for its flat + grouped feeds, the bulk toolbar, the per-row
context menu, the select-all tri-state, and the delete confirmation. This page
is its archived host: it binds the feeds, joins rows with the page's two web
hooks, renders the PageContainer-equivalent header, and wires the mutations.

New files (package io.teslasync.android.notifications.archived):
  - ArchivedPageModel.kt     Registration(ROUTE_ID notificationsArchived,
                             WEB_PATH /notifications/archived, SLUG ArchivedPage),
                             ARCHIVED_FILTERS (archived=true), toInboxNotifications
                             / toInboxGroups (the verbatim ruleMap/vehicleMap join),
                             parseIsoMillis, Resource.mapData, recordArchivedPageOpened.
  - ArchivedPageSource.kt     ArchivedPageSource seam + archivedPageSourceOf(repo,
                             vehiclesStore): archived notificationLogs/groups,
                             alertRules, vehicles + the 6 inbox mutations.
  - ArchivedPageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel; flatState/groupState as
                             StateFlow<UiState<…>> via refreshTrigger ▸ flatMapLatest
                             ▸ combine(logs, alertRules, vehicles) ▸ mapData ▸
                             asUiState; refresh/retry; the 7 mutation callbacks
                             (each refreshes the family on success); recordViewOpened.
  - ArchivedPage.kt           Stateful entry (viewModel factory) + stateful overload
                             (collectAsStateWithLifecycle, back-dispatcher seam for
                             "Back to inbox", ArchivedPageActions) + stateless
                             ArchivedPageContent (header + InboxBody archived=true)
                             + ArchivedPageHeader (PageTitle + subtitle + copy-link
                             IconButton + Back-to-inbox Button).
  - ArchivedPageHost.kt       ArchivedRoute() binds HttpNotificationsRepository
                             (shared resilient client + offline cache) + the shared
                             S8 VehiclesStore; ArchivedPageHost.register() ->
                             PageHosts.register("notificationsArchived").

Edits (registration + string catalog + ledger only):
  - TeslaSyncApplication.kt   import + ArchivedPageHost.register() at process start.
  - res/values/strings.xml    3 keys (translation_notifications_archived_{title,
                             subtitle,backToInbox}); copy-link reuses the existing
                             translation_common_copyLink_action.
  - apps/parity/android-ledger.json  page:notifications/Archived row (done, 4/4).

Notes:
  - SI: no notification field is unit-bearing (ids, ISO timestamps, free text, a
    severity enum) — no SI conversion; date/locale formatting is at the render
    boundary inside InboxBody (S5).
  - States: InboxBody renders loading / empty(archived) / error+retry / content /
    stale-offline for the bound feeds (verified by the shared InboxBodyUiTest).
  - i18n: every visible literal via stringResource (ADR-014); web key names kept.
  - a11y: PageTitle heading, copy-link IconButton contentDescription, Button label;
    InboxBody supplies row/select/restore/freshness content descriptions (ADR-015).
  - Nav: "Back to inbox" uses the system back-dispatcher — the sanctioned page-host
    seam (no LocalNavController is exposed to hosts), mirroring GlancePage.

